                                "sense_id": "1bb94a84-6583-3172-bf8f-6c0d0a8e9bcc",
                                "text": "When they looked upon me, in my suffering, they would sigh, and exclaim, \"Oh, Yoh!\" (Oh! dear! Oh! pity!)"
